<<
/A 2195 0 R
/Alt (Infographic showing research applications for genetic diseases and infectious agents. Left side lists genetic disease models \(CF, ADPKD, Alport, Down, PD, CJD, D-CAA, PCD, GSD-Ia, XLRS\) with icons and targeted studies. Right side lists infectious disease models \(SARS-CoV-2, Influenza, Salmonella, Cryptosporidium, Zika, HIV, JC virus, Mpox, UPEC\) with corresponding icons and research aims including viral kinetics, neuroinvasion, immune-organoid co-culture, antiviral and phage therapy. Bottom legend explains symbols for immune co-culture, gene editing, and biobank protocols.)
